{# The footer of a card that saves itself: the unsaved-changes hint, the status
   slot and the Save button. Included by the card partials when `card_url` is
   set, inside the card's `<form data-card class="group">`.

   Context: result_id, the id of the status slot; message / ok, an optional
   alert to draw in it (the whole-card fragments pass them, the statement
   leaves its slot empty and has its response swapped in).

   The hint is always in the markup and shown by `group-data-[dirty]:`, which
   the script in challenge-edit.jinja sets on the form. The class is written
   out whole so Tailwind sees it. #}
<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-5">
  {# No whitespace inside the slot, so `empty:hidden` holds when there is no alert. #}
  <div id="{{ result_id }}" class="empty:hidden flex-1">{% if message %}{% include "f-edit-result.jinja" %}{% endif %}</div>
  <span class="hidden group-data-[dirty]:inline text-xs font-semibold text-warning ml-auto">● unsaved changes</span>
  <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary shadow-md shadow-primary/30">
    <span class="submit-label">Save</span>
    <span class="htmx-indicator loading loading-spinner loading-sm"></span>
  </button>
</div>
